     Pap shu yauh nai hiolmo toi,
     Chini khe hiol tong mo;
     Pap kasomo kila Nini jonom zaga no,
     Nini sal wo toikhouhmo khakchang ye tong yauh nai,

4.   Bo purthim le kma thanng nai,
