     Toikhouhnai chung no reing nai,
     Ha no chung khoinang nai;
     Khristo hiaomo brouh rao Chumari raja cha nai,
     Hiaomo kplouh thanng ha khakchang srau di Halleluia.

1.   O, Isor nung khalaunai,
     Lalaimo sikhruh di;
     Nini hammari kbangma,
     Brao ni thing yo ri di;
     Nung hammo no nai lai ye,
     Hammari brao mai thou;
     Thoi ya ha pal tong yauh nai,
     Brao ni kau thir ong thou.

2.   Purthim wo Nung tong phuh wo,
