3.   Nung no khathoi mai yauh nai,
     Probu Nung nangkhruh di;
     Uana ye imang kha pho,
     Nung brao no nangkhruh di;
     Brao thangmo ni sal thanng pho,
     Purthim no khuinang pho;
     Jonom wo pal tong yauh nai,
