     Abin baoh solemo soitan jeba,
     Nung mthaoh maimo si ye reing mi ong khe;
     Ain stur nouhkha ksom rao mthaoh di,

	''Thaoh, thaoh si di''

1.   Purthim bernanng ye,
     Uklau naihoih ya ye;
     Khaka hinngsao nai rao,
     Boikhonto wo hinngsao tong ou;
